    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor of the Lost World is a survival barrage game similar to Rogue. In the lost doomsday world, deal with thousands of enemies, challenge strong enemies step by step through learning skills, improving abilities, and obtaining props, and ultimately achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. All skills are automatically released, and you need to avoid attacks from groups of enemies and strive to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/965e62b587cbfd82d938f32c6c37fdec.poster.avif?t=1752891260\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/965e62b587cbfd82d938f32c6c37fdec.webm?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/965e62b587cbfd82d938f32c6c37fdec.mp4?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Fast pace (20 minutes per game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. There are dozens of skills for you to choose from, each of which can be upgraded to enhance your abilities. I believe you can build a satisfactory playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/fc1ccaeb954de02f2ec37520fa95e791.poster.avif?t=1752891260\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/fc1ccaeb954de02f2ec37520fa95e791.webm?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/fc1ccaeb954de02f2ec37520fa95e791.mp4?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. There are also dozens of relic props for you to choose from, further enhancing the joy of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d3873aa311aec4ad076d071b379a0448.avif?t=1752891260\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Pick up experience to upgrade, and each upgrade will randomly result in multiple ability improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d2b7e084b3e849cf0738749e0c874a5b.poster.avif?t=1752891260\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d2b7e084b3e849cf0738749e0c874a5b.webm?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d2b7e084b3e849cf0738749e0c874a5b.mp4?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Multiple characters, maps, difficulty levels, and game modes are waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Survivor of the Lost World is a survival barrage game similar to Rogue. In the lost doomsday world, deal with thousands of enemies, challenge strong enemies step by step through learning skills, improving abilities, and obtaining props, and ultimately achieve victory.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Game features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. All skills are automatically released, and you need to avoid attacks from groups of enemies and strive to survive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/965e62b587cbfd82d938f32c6c37fdec.poster.avif?t=1752891260\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/965e62b587cbfd82d938f32c6c37fdec.webm?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/965e62b587cbfd82d938f32c6c37fdec.mp4?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Fast pace (20 minutes per game).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. There are dozens of skills for you to choose from, each of which can be upgraded to enhance your abilities. I believe you can build a satisfactory playing style.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/fc1ccaeb954de02f2ec37520fa95e791.poster.avif?t=1752891260\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/fc1ccaeb954de02f2ec37520fa95e791.webm?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/fc1ccaeb954de02f2ec37520fa95e791.mp4?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. There are also dozens of relic props for you to choose from, further enhancing the joy of growth.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d3873aa311aec4ad076d071b379a0448.avif?t=1752891260\" width=616 height=372 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Pick up experience to upgrade, and each upgrade will randomly result in multiple ability improvements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d2b7e084b3e849cf0738749e0c874a5b.poster.avif?t=1752891260\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d2b7e084b3e849cf0738749e0c874a5b.webm?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3696180/extras/d2b7e084b3e849cf0738749e0c874a5b.mp4?t=1752891260\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >6. Multiple characters, maps, difficulty levels, and game modes are waiting for you to experience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
